Package: openrar
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Section: utils
Description: Modern C++17 RAR 5.0 archiver CLI
 OpenRAR is a modern, high-performance, memory-safe C++17 implementation
 of the RAR 5.0 archive format specification.
 .
 This package provides the command-line utility 'openrar' for extracting,
 testing, listing, creating, and repairing RAR 5.0 archives, with full
 support for encryption, recovery records, and archive migration.

Package: libopenrar1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Modern C++17 RAR 5.0 frozen C ABI shared library
 OpenRAR is a modern, high-performance C++17 RAR 5.0 archive engine.
 .
 This package provides the frozen C ABI shared library (libopenrar.so.1)
 used by native applications, language bindings (Python ctypes, C# P/Invoke,
 WASM/Node.js), and third-party tools.

Package: libopenrar-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libopenrar1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for OpenRAR (headers, pkg-config, CMake)
 OpenRAR is a modern, high-performance C++17 RAR 5.0 archive engine.
 .
 This package contains C/C++ header files (openrar_dll.h, openrar.hpp,
 version.h), the unversioned shared library symlink, static archive,
 pkg-config metadata (openrar.pc), and CMake export modules.
